# Plans

One folder per version, `vX.Y.Z.T/`, created by the Agentic SDD skills on the
version's `build/vX.Y.Z.T` branch:

| File | Written by | Content |
|------|------------|---------|
| `requirement.md` | `/engineer:requirement` | Approved requirement, REQ IDs, EARS acceptance criteria, version bump, lifecycle `status:` |
| `plan.md` | `/engineer:plan` | Problem statement, before vs after, backward compatibility, WBS goals with Definition of Done and State |
| `architecture.md` | `/engineer:architect` | What changed in `docs/` for this version and guidance per goal |
| `test-report.md` | `engineer:run-tests` | Latest full test run |

These files record **changes** per version and are not rewritten afterwards.
The current behaviour of the product is described by the feature tests in
`docs/test-cases/feature-tests/`.

Run `/engineer:status` to see every version in flight.
